content.text:
For a new project, use the new package name. Since August 2026 (v1), `@cloudflare/vitest-pool-workers` is published as **`@cloudflare/vitest-plugin`**. The configuration API is the same, so only the package name, imports and TypeScript `types` entries are different.

### 1. Install
```bash
npm i -D vitest@^4.1.0 @cloudflare/vitest-plugin
```
You need:
- Vitest 4.1 or later
- An ES-modules Worker
- A `compatibility_date` of `2022-10-31` or later

### 2. `vitest.config.ts`
```ts
import { cloudflareTest } from "@cloudflare/vitest-plugin";
import { defineConfig } from "vitest/config";

export default defineConfig({
	plugins: [
		cloudflareTest({
			wrangler: { configPath: "./wrangler.jsonc" },
			// Optional: add or override bindings for tests only.
			// These take precedence over the Wrangler config.
			// miniflare: { kvNamespaces: ["TEST_NAMESPACE"] },
		}),
	],
});
```
This uses the Vite-plugin style (`plugins: [cloudflareTest(...)]`). The older `defineWorkersConfig` / `test.poolOptions.workers` style from before v0.13 doesn't work with Vitest 4.

### 3. TypeScript types
Run `npx wrangler types` to generate `Env`, then create `test/tsconfig.json`:
```jsonc
{
	"extends": "../tsconfig.json",
	"compilerOptions": {
		"moduleResolution": "bundler",
		"types": ["@cloudflare/vitest-plugin/types"]
	},
	"include": ["./**/*.ts", "../src/worker-configuration.d.ts"]
}
```

### 4. A first test (`test/index.spec.ts`)
```ts
import { SELF } from "cloudflare:test";
import { expect, it } from "vitest";

it("responds", async () => {
	const res = await SELF.fetch("https://example.com/");
	expect(res.status).toBe(200);
});
```
Then run `npx vitest`.

**If you specifically need the old package name** (for example, to match an existing setup), install `@cloudflare/vitest-pool-workers` and change the import and `types` entry to `@cloudflare/vitest-pool-workers`. Everything else above stays the same. To move an existing project to the new name, run `npx @cloudflare/codemods vitest:pool-workers-to-vitest-plugin`.

Sources:
- [Write your first test (Cloudflare docs)](https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/testing/vitest-integration/write-your-first-test/)
- [Migrate to @cloudflare/vitest-plugin](https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/testing/vitest-integration/migration-guides/migrate-to-vitest-plugin/)
- [Migrate from Vitest 3 to Vitest 4](https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/testing/vitest-integration/migration-guides/migrate-from-vitest-3-to-vitest-4/)
- [Changelog: vitest-pool-workers is now vitest-plugin](https://docs-durable-objects-instance-replaced-errors.previews.developers.cloudflare.com/changelog/post/2026-08-19-vitest-plugin/)

